# working notes: handoffs and the mode idea list. Kept out of the repo because
# they are half-finished thinking addressed to whoever picks the work up next,
# not documentation, and a reader landing on them from GitHub would take them
# for the latter.
docs/next-session.md
docs/mode-ideas.md

# Signing keys and anything shaped like one. Never in the repository: this is
# a public tree, `git add -A` is routine, and the Android signing key is the
# app's identity — leaked, anyone can ship an update that installs over yours,
# and it cannot be rotated once a release is signed with it.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
key.properties
